This module reimplements editor behavior specified by Visual Studio Code
(Code - OSS), read at commit ef5ca45a6e545e4767e0117905ee9d6120b86e11. No
VS Code source is copied. Where an algorithm follows VS Code closely, such as
the association of file names with languages, the image preview's zoom levels
and gestures, and the Git staging of selected ranges, the MIT license below
covers it.

